# Uploads & Runtime Data
# =========================
backend/uploads/
# NOTE: do NOT ignore backend/workspace/ — despite the name it is a SOURCE
# package (the WorkspaceSummary projection imported by app.py), not runtime
# data. Runtime data lives under backend/uploads/. Ignoring it here previously
# caused the package to be silently untracked and deleted by `git clean`.

